---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import { u } from '../../lib/url';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import { COURSES } from '../../data/courses';

const all = await getCollection('learn');

const stats = new Map<string, { chapters: number; modules: Set<string> }>();
for (const c of COURSES) stats.set(c.id, { chapters: 0, modules: new Set() });
for (const e of all) {
  const course = e.id.split('/')[0];
  const s = stats.get(course);
  if (!s) continue;
  s.chapters += 1;
  s.modules.add(e.data.module);
}
---

<BaseLayout
  title="学习中心"
  description="野生思考学习中心：按顺序学的技术路线。Linux、Python、网络三门课，每门分模块、按章节推进，讲清原理再动手验证。"
  active="learn"
>
  <section class="section learn-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-head">
        <div class="kicker">LEARN · 学习中心</div>
        <h1>选一门，<br />从第一行命令开始走</h1>
        <p>
          不是文章列表——是排好顺序的课。每门课分模块、按章节推进，左边是进度树，
          右边讲到第几章就点第几章；学完一章能自己验证，才算真的会了。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="learn-grid">
        {
          COURSES.map((c) => {
            const s = stats.get(c.id)!;
            return (
              <a class="course-card" href={u(`/learn/${c.id}`)} style={`--card-accent:${c.accent}`}>
                <div class="cc-top">
                  <span class="cc-icon"><Icon name={c.icon} size={18} /></span>
                  <span class="cc-tag">{c.tag}</span>
                </div>
                <h2>{c.name}</h2>
                <div class="cc-en">{c.en}</div>
                <p class="cc-desc">{c.desc}</p>

                <ul class="cc-can">
                  {c.can.map((x) => (
                    <li>{x}</li>
                  ))}
                </ul>

                <div class="cc-foot">
                  <span class="cc-meta">
                    {s.modules.size} 个模块 · {s.chapters} 章
                  </span>
                  <span class="cc-go">
                    开始学习
                    <Icon name="arrowRight" size={14} />
                  </span>
                </div>
              </a>
            );
          })
        }
      </div>

      <div class="learn-note">
        <div class="ln-item">
          <b>怎么用</b>
          <p>按章节顺序往下读，每章末尾有「动手做」。做完能自己验证结果，再翻下一章。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ln-item">
          <b>读到一半卡住</b>
          <p>回到对应专题查更深的文章；课程讲"是什么、怎么做"，专题讲"为什么、出问题怎么查"。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ln-item">
          <b>完全不懂技术</b>
          <p>先从 Linux 课的第 1 章读，再用「从零开始学技术」专题补齐背景。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .learn-page {
    padding-top: 54px;
    padding-bottom: 90px;
  }

  .learn-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(330px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .course-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 22px 24px 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--panel);
    transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .course-card::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(
      120% 90% at 0% 0%,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--card-accent) 12%, transparent),
      transparent 60%
    );
    opacity: 0.8;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .course-card:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--card-accent) 45%, transparent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .cc-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .cc-icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--card-accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--card-accent) 10%, transparent);
  }

  .cc-tag {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    color: var(--card-accent);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--card-accent) 35%, transparent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--card-accent) 8%, transparent);
  }

  .course-card h2 {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .cc-en {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--dim);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .cc-desc {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .cc-can {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .cc-can li {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    padding-left: 16px;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cc-can li::before {
    content: '→';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    color: var(--card-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .cc-foot {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--line);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .cc-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--dim);
  }

  .cc-go {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--card-accent);
  }

  .learn-note {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 34px;
    padding-top: 26px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .ln-item b {
    display: block;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .ln-item p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--dim);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .learn-note {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
